<title>FRANCE: Cr.Lyonnais no comment on Lisbon unit sale report.</title>
<headline>Cr.Lyonnais no comment on Lisbon unit sale report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Credit Lyonnais declined to comment on Friday on a Spanish newspaper report that Spain's Caixa da Galicia was bidding for its Portuguese subsidiary.</p>
<p>A Credit Lyonnais spokesman said he was aware of the report in Spain's Cinco Dias but would make no comment.</p>
<p>The Lisbon bourse earlier suspended trading in shares of the local Credit Lyonnais unit.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
